### Missing token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures

### Wrong token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures
Authorization: Bearer wrong-token

### Unknown capture id → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures/unknown-id
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Invalid capture id → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures/bad/id
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Invalid method filter → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?method=FOO
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Invalid limit filter → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?limit=-5
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Invalid order filter → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?order=sideways
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Non-GET method → 405
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
